-- Role matrix for 20261011100000_admissions_core_applicants, STRUCTURE file (admissions slice 3a,
-- docs/admissions/PORT-PLAN.md): direct writes denied for every role, the
-- grants and RLS shape, the checks (legacy values accepted, bad values
-- refused), the cascade, the two triggers, and the slice 15 import shape.
